nces, browsing activity).<br /><strong>Location Data:</strong> With your consent, we may collect location information to improve event recommendations.</p>";s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}s:11:"_typography";a:1:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ebebeb";s:2:"id";s:6:"vbnfvt";s:4:"name";s:9:"Color #11";}}}}i:24;a:6:{s:2:"id";s:6:"ewdeth";s:4:"name";s:7:"divider";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:2:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ffffff";s:3:"rgb";s:24:"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)";s:3:"hsl";s:22:"hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.2)";}s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"40";}}s:11:"themeStyles";a:0:{}}i:25;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"giuzut";s:4:"name";s:4:"text";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:322:"<p><strong>2. How We Use Your Information</strong><br />We use your information to:</p><ul><li>Provide and improve our services.</li><li>Send updates, event notifications, and promotional materials.</li><li>Process payments securely.<p>Ensure compliance with age verification and content moderation policies.</p></li></ul>";s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}s:11:"_typography";a:1:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ebebeb";s:2:"id";s:6:"vbnfvt";s:4:"name";s:9:"Color #11";}}}}i:26;a:6:{s:2:"id";s:6:"twtnmu";s:4:"name";s:7:"divider";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:2:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ffffff";s:3:"rgb";s:24:"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)";s:3:"hsl";s:22:"hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.2)";}s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"40";}}s:11:"themeStyles";a:0:{}}i:27;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"ccjnyd";s:4:"name";s:4:"text";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:848:"<p>By providing your phone number or email address, you agree to receive updates, event promotions, and notifications from WGO4Y.</p><p><strong>Opt-In:</strong></p><ul><li>Customers can opt-in to receive communications by:</li><li>Signing up on our website or mobile apps.</li><li>Texting a designated keyword to our toll-free number.</li><li>Subscribing to our email newsletter.</li></ul><p><strong>Opt-Out:<br /></strong><br />You can opt-out of communications at any time by:</p><ul><li>Texting "STOP" to our toll-free number to unsubscribe from text messages.</li><li>Clicking the "Unsubscribe" link in our emails to stop receiving email communications.</li><li>Contact us directly at <a href="mailto:whatsgoingon4you@gmail.com">whatsgoingon4you@gmail.com</a> or <a href="tel:+18006102176">800-610-2176</a> to manage your preferences.</li></ul>";s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}s:11:"_typography";a:1:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ebebeb";s:2:"id";s:6:"vbnfvt";s:4:"name";s:9:"Color #11";}}}}i:28;a:6:{s:2:"id";s:6:"znkxfa";s:4:"name";s:7:"divider";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:2:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ffffff";s:3:"rgb";s:24:"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)";s:3:"hsl";s:22:"hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.2)";}s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"40";}}s:11:"themeStyles";a:0:{}}i:29;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"bnlrwc";s:4:"name";s:4:"text";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:193:"<p><strong>4. Data Security</strong><br />We use encryption and secure payment gateways to protect your data. Access to your personal information is restricted to authorized personnel only.</p>";s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}s:11:"_typography";a:1:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ebebeb";s:2:"id";s:6:"vbnfvt";s:4:"name";s:9:"Color #11";}}}}i:30;a:6:{s:2:"id";s:6:"imexho";s:4:"name";s:7:"divider";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:2:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ffffff";s:3:"rgb";s:24:"rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)";s:3:"hsl";s:22:"hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.2)";}s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"40";}}s:11:"themeStyles";a:0:{}}i:31;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"zdzlun";s:4:"name";s:4:"text";s:6:"parent";s:6:"lqzcjo";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:267:"<p><strong>5. Sharing Your Informa