sonal Shopping: Helping clients find standout pieces for their wardrobe. <br />- Pricing: $250/session (up to 3 hours).</p>";s:11:"_typography";a:1:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ebebeb";s:2:"id";s:6:"vbnfvt";s:4:"name";s:9:"Color #11";}}s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}}}i:10;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"rrwjvj";s:4:"name";s:7:"heading";s:6:"parent";s:6:"ugxxkc";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:14:"Collaborations";s:3:"tag";s:2:"h3";s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}}}i:11;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"seasce";s:4:"name";s:4:"text";s:6:"parent";s:6:"ugxxkc";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:196:"<p>Nina is open to working with event planners, photographers, and private clients. Whether it’s a red carpet look or a closet revamp, Nina brings creativity and confidence to every project.</p>";s:11:"_typography";a:1:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ebebeb";s:2:"id";s:6:"vbnfvt";s:4:"name";s:9:"Color #11";}}s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}}}i:12;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"mbyuqr";s:4:"name";s:7:"heading";s:6:"parent";s:6:"ugxxkc";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:21:"Networking Event Post";s:3:"tag";s:2:"h3";s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}}}i:13;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"pgcnrg";s:4:"name";s:4:"text";s:6:"parent";s:6:"ugxxkc";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:3:{s:4:"text";s:224:"<p>Nina “Trendsetter” Blake is here to transform your style! Based in Columbia, SC, Nina specializes in wardrobe styling, closet revamps, and personal shopping. Book her now for a bold and unique styling experience!"</p>";s:11:"_typography";a:1:{s:5:"color";a:3:{s:3:"hex";s:7:"#ebebeb";s:2:"id";s:6:"vbnfvt";s:4:"name";s:9:"Color #11";}}s:7:"_margin";a:1:{s:3:"top";s:2:"20";}}}i:14;a:5:{s:2:"id";s:6:"bywphn";s:4:"name";s:5:"block";s:6:"parent";s:6:"hzopqv";s:8:"children";a:1:{i:0;s:6:"uljocn";}s:8:"settings";a:0:{}}i:15;a:6:{s:2:"id";s:6:"uljocn";s:4:"name";s:5:"image";s:6:"parent";s:6:"bywphn";s:8:"children";a:0:{}s:8:"settings";a:5:{s:5: